<v Daniel>Chicago who loves baseball.</v>

171
00:14:47.307 --> 00:14:47.788
<v Maya>And it worked.</v>

172
00:14:48.428 --> 00:14:53.773
<v Daniel>very well with that persona prompt it was picked as the human 73 of the time</v>

173
00:14:53.973 --> 00:14:54.294
<v Maya>wow</v>

